  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "See https://github.com/JefferyLeo/boostgrid/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md for the full per-version log. v2.5.2 closes a docs gap that was causing silent host-page failures: when Bootstrap's JS bundle isn't loaded, the toolbar's page-size picker and columns-visibility menu render but never open. The toolbar now emits a one-shot console.warn naming the missing dependency, and the docs site + README now spell out the four required host-page loads (Bootstrap CSS, Bootstrap JS, icon font, Boostgrid). v2.5.1 fixed the CDN script-tag MIME issue (.umd.cjs → .umd.js mirror). v2.5.0 introduced element pooling under virtual scroll and the scrollToRow(index) public method. Bundle 16.7 KB brotli, ceiling 18 KB.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Bootstrap 5 data grid (vanilla TypeScript, under 18 KB brotli, zero runtime dependencies).",
